# <%= it.dev.displayName %> — <%= it.quarter.label %> Success Story

**Manager:** <%= it.team.manager %>  ·  **Period:** <%= it.quarter.from %> → <%= it.quarter.to %>

## Headline

<%= it.narration.headline %>

## Quantified impact

- **<%= it.dev.prsMerged %>** pull requests merged
  (<%= it.dev.prsByKind.feature %> features, <%= it.dev.prsByKind.bugfix %> fixes, <%= it.dev.prsByKind.refactor %> refactors, <%= it.dev.prsByKind.infra %> infra, <%= it.dev.prsByKind.docs %> docs, <%= it.dev.prsByKind.other %> other)
- **<%= it.dev.filesTouched %>** files touched across **<%= it.dev.crossRepoCollaboration %>** service<%= it.dev.crossRepoCollaboration === 1 ? "" : "s" %>
- **<%= it.dev.reviewsGiven %>** code reviews given on teammates' PRs
- **<%= it.dev.linkedIssuesClosed.length %>** issue<%= it.dev.linkedIssuesClosed.length === 1 ? "" : "s" %> closed via linked PRs
<% if (it.dev.shippedMilestones.length > 0) { -%>
- **Milestones shipped:** <%= it.dev.shippedMilestones.join(", ") %>
<% } -%>

## Highlight projects
<% if (it.dev.topPRs.length === 0) { %>

_No merged PRs in the scanned repositories for this quarter._
<% } -%>
<% it.dev.topPRs.forEach(function(pr){ %>
### <%= pr.title %>

- Repo: `<%= pr.repo %>` · PR [#<%= pr.number %>](<%= pr.url %>) · merged <%= it.fmt.date(pr.mergedAt) %>
- Reviewers: <%= pr.reviewers.length ? pr.reviewers.join(", ") : "—" %>
- Linked issues: <%= pr.linkedIssues.length ? pr.linkedIssues.join(", ") : "—" %>
- Why it mattered: _<%= it.fmt.firstParagraph(pr.body) || "(manager: add a sentence here)" %>_
<% }); %>
## Collaboration & leadership

<%= it.narration.collaboration %>

## Suggested talking points

<% it.narration.talkingPoints.forEach(function(tp){ -%>
- <%= tp %>
<% }); -%>

---

_Generated by shipreport v<%= it.version %> on <%= it.generatedAt %>.
Numbers are pulled directly from GitHub; prose is a draft for the manager to refine._
